{"lines": [{"text": "Two police officers rang the bell of a museum in Boston, in the middle of the night. Eighty minutes later, half a billion dollars of art was gone.", "start": 0.3, "end": 9.348, "spec": {"shot": "g_hook_door", "ui": "hook500"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Two", 0.096, 0.228], ["police", 0.228, 0.613], ["officers", 0.625, 1.262], ["rang", 1.43, 1.815], ["the", 1.815, 1.911], ["bell", 1.923, 2.284], ["of", 2.296, 2.368], ["a", 2.38, 2.416], ["museum", 2.416, 2.957], ["in", 2.957, 3.041], ["Boston", 3.041, 3.606], ["in", 4.002, 4.062], ["the", 4.062, 4.123], ["middle", 4.135, 4.387], ["of", 4.399, 4.459], ["the", 4.459, 4.507], ["night", 4.519, 4.904], ["Eighty", 5.276, 5.445], ["minutes", 5.445, 5.685], ["later", 5.697, 6.046], ["half", 6.43, 6.719], ["a", 6.839, 6.923], ["billion", 7.031, 7.428], ["dollars", 7.428, 7.752], ["of", 7.764, 7.824], ["art", 7.837, 8.125], ["was", 8.137, 8.329], ["gone", 8.329, 8.702]]}, {"text": "Thirteen works, including a Rembrandt and a Vermeer. And to this day, not a single one has been found.", "start": 9.768, "end": 16.584, "spec": {"shot": "g_hook_frames", "ui": "missing"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Thirteen", 0.144, 0.565], ["works", 0.577, 1.034], ["including", 1.406, 1.767], ["a", 1.767, 1.815], ["Rembrandt", 1.827, 2.428], ["and", 2.548, 2.632], ["a", 2.632, 2.656], ["Vermeer", 2.668, 3.245], ["And", 3.63, 3.678], ["to", 3.678, 3.762], ["this", 3.762, 3.954], ["day", 3.954, 4.291], ["not", 4.724, 4.916], ["a", 4.928, 4.976], ["single", 4.988, 5.493], ["one", 5.493, 5.685], ["has", 5.685, 5.805], ["been", 5.805, 5.962], ["found", 5.962, 6.466]]}, {"text": "That's number one on this list. But first, five other heists so bold they almost look fake.", "start": 17.004, "end": 22.548, "spec": {"shot": "count_wall", "ui": "list"}, "afx": null, "words": [["That's", 0.108, 0.264], ["number", 0.276, 0.505], ["one", 0.517, 0.721], ["on", 0.721, 0.805], ["this", 0.805, 0.974], ["list", 0.986, 1.43], ["But", 1.815, 1.899], ["first", 1.899, 2.428], ["five", 2.62, 2.849], ["other", 2.849, 2.969], ["heists", 2.969, 3.353], ["so", 3.365, 3.738], ["bold", 3.87, 4.195], ["they", 4.207, 4.315], ["almost", 4.315, 4.615], ["look", 4.615, 4.724], ["fake", 4.736, 5.192]]}, {"text": "And watch closely. Because almost every one of these crews made one tiny mistake.", "start": 22.968, "end": 28.44, "spec": {"shot": "magnifier", "ui": "mistake"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.168], ["watch", 0.168, 0.409], ["closely", 0.409, 0.998], ["Because", 1.394, 1.611], ["almost", 1.611, 1.935], ["every", 2.055, 2.272], ["one", 2.272, 2.404], ["of", 2.416, 2.452], ["these", 2.452, 2.608], ["crews", 2.62, 3.101], ["made", 3.269, 3.642], ["one", 3.714, 4.111], ["tiny", 4.123, 4.495], ["mistake", 4.495, 5.132]]}, {"text": "Number six. England, August 8th, 1963. Just after three in the morning, a Royal Mail train is rolling through the dark.", "start": 28.86, "end": 38.172, "spec": {"shot": "t_train_night", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n6"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.276], ["six", 0.288, 0.793], ["England", 1.178, 1.538], ["August 8th, 1963", 1.803, 4.243], ["Just", 4.639, 4.796], ["after", 4.796, 5.0], ["three", 5.0, 5.325], ["in", 5.324, 5.409], ["the", 5.409, 5.445], ["morning", 5.445, 5.865], ["a", 6.262, 6.298], ["Royal", 6.31, 6.647], ["Mail", 6.647, 6.887], ["train", 6.887, 7.32], ["is", 7.452, 7.608], ["rolling", 7.62, 8.257], ["through", 8.269, 8.474], ["the", 8.474, 8.546], ["dark", 8.546, 8.966]]}, {"text": "It's carrying sacks of used banknotes. Millions of them.", "start": 38.592, "end": 42.216, "spec": {"shot": "t_sacks", "ui": "sacks"}, "afx": null, "words": [["It's", 0.072, 0.168], ["carrying", 0.168, 0.625], ["sacks", 0.625, 1.154], ["of", 1.154, 1.238], ["used", 1.238, 1.575], ["banknotes", 1.575, 2.248], ["Millions", 2.632, 2.969], ["of", 2.981, 3.041], ["them", 3.053, 3.257]]}, {"text": "Up ahead, a signal turns red. So the driver stops the train.", "start": 42.636, "end": 46.86, "spec": {"shot": "t_signal", "ui": "red"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Up", 0.096, 0.192], ["ahead", 0.192, 0.577], ["a", 0.986, 1.022], ["signal", 1.022, 1.418], ["turns", 1.43, 1.707], ["red", 1.707, 2.031], ["So", 2.428, 2.524], ["the", 2.536, 2.608], ["driver", 2.608, 3.041], ["stops", 3.041, 3.401], ["the", 3.401, 3.474], ["train", 3.474, 3.87]]}, {"text": "But the signal was a trick. The gang had covered the green light with a glove, and powered the red light with a battery.", "start": 47.28, "end": 53.472, "spec": {"shot": "t_glove", "ui": "glove"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.108, 0.192], ["the", 0.204, 0.276], ["signal", 0.276, 0.577], ["was", 0.577, 0.685], ["a", 0.697, 0.733], ["trick", 0.733, 1.178], ["The", 1.562, 1.635], ["gang", 1.635, 1.887], ["had", 1.887, 2.019], ["covered", 2.031, 2.284], ["the", 2.284, 2.344], ["green", 2.344, 2.704], ["light", 2.716, 3.017], ["with", 3.017, 3.173], ["a", 3.185, 3.221], ["glove", 3.221, 3.738], ["and", 4.147, 4.255], ["powered", 4.255, 4.615], ["the", 4.627, 4.687], ["red", 4.688, 4.928], ["light", 4.928, 5.192], ["with", 5.204, 5.337], ["a", 5.337, 5.373], ["battery", 5.373, 5.841]]}, {"text": "Fifteen men stormed the train. The driver, Jack Mills, was hit over the head.", "start": 53.892, "end": 59.34, "spec": {"shot": "t_storm", "ui": "fifteen"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Fifteen", 0.156, 0.577], ["men", 0.577, 0.913], ["stormed", 1.106, 1.454], ["the", 1.466, 1.502], ["train", 1.514, 1.899], ["The", 2.284, 2.344], ["driver", 2.356, 2.885], ["Jack", 3.125, 3.413], ["Mills", 3.413, 3.906], ["was", 4.087, 4.243], ["hit", 4.255, 4.507], ["over", 4.519, 4.688], ["the", 4.699, 4.76], ["head", 4.772, 5.096]]}, {"text": "They unloaded more than two-and-a-half million pounds. Today, that's close to fifty million.", "start": 59.76, "end": 65.04, "spec": {"shot": "t_unload", "ui": "gbp26"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.096, 0.228], ["unloaded", 0.228, 0.661], ["more", 0.673, 1.022], ["than", 1.034, 1.19], ["two-and-a-half", 1.202, 1.875], ["million", 1.887, 2.272], ["pounds", 2.272, 2.873], ["Today", 3.257, 3.498], ["that's", 3.51, 3.69], ["close", 3.69, 3.99], ["to", 3.99, 4.087], ["fifty", 4.099, 4.507], ["million", 4.519, 4.928]]}, {"text": "Then they hid at a farmhouse. And while they waited, they played Monopoly. With the real money.", "start": 65.46, "end": 71.34, "spec": {"shot": "t_monopoly", "ui": "monopoly"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.156], ["they", 0.156, 0.24], ["hid", 0.252, 0.541], ["at", 0.553, 0.625], ["a", 0.637, 0.673], ["farmhouse", 0.673, 1.514], ["And", 1.911, 2.019], ["while", 2.031, 2.236], ["they", 2.248, 2.38], ["waited", 2.38, 2.897], ["they", 3.149, 3.281], ["played", 3.293, 3.642], ["Monopoly", 3.654, 4.351], ["With", 4.724, 4.82], ["the", 4.82, 4.904], ["real", 4.916, 5.168], ["money", 5.168, 5.529]]}, {"text": "That was the mistake. Police found the farm, and fingerprints all over the game.", "start": 71.76, "end": 76.44, "spec": {"shot": "t_prints", "ui": "prints"}, "afx": null, "words": [["That", 0.096, 0.204], ["was", 0.204, 0.312], ["the", 0.325, 0.397], ["mistake", 0.397, 0.913], ["Police", 1.298, 1.635], ["found", 1.635, 1.899], ["the", 1.899, 1.947], ["farm", 1.947, 2.38], ["and", 2.632, 2.764], ["fingerprints", 2.885, 3.534], ["all", 3.546, 3.786], ["over", 3.786, 3.918], ["the", 3.918, 3.978], ["game", 3.99, 4.339]]}, {"text": "The leaders got thirty years in prison. One of them, Ronnie Biggs, escaped over the wall on a rope ladder, and stayed on the run for about thirty-six years.", "start": 76.86, "end": 85.932, "spec": {"shot": "t_biggs", "ui": "yrs30"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.168], ["leaders", 0.168, 0.541], ["got", 0.541, 0.769], ["thirty", 0.781, 1.214], ["years", 1.214, 1.587], ["in", 1.587, 1.671], ["prison", 1.683, 2.079], ["One", 2.476, 2.644], ["of", 2.644, 2.728], ["them", 2.728, 2.993], ["Ronnie", 3.245, 3.558], ["Biggs", 3.57, 4.183], ["escaped", 4.327, 4.736], ["over", 4.736, 4.916], ["the", 4.916, 4.988], ["wall", 4.988, 5.349], ["on", 5.349, 5.457], ["a", 5.457, 5.493], ["rope", 5.493, 5.805], ["ladder", 5.817, 6.202], ["and", 6.574, 6.635], ["stayed", 6.635, 6.887], ["on", 6.899, 6.995], ["the", 7.007, 7.055], ["run", 7.055, 7.308], ["for", 7.308, 7.44], ["about", 7.44, 7.656], ["thirty-six", 7.656, 8.233], ["years", 8.233, 8.714]]}, {"text": "And most of the money was never found.", "start": 86.352, "end": 88.464, "spec": {"shot": "t_empty", "ui": "notfound"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.18], ["most", 0.18, 0.409], ["of", 0.409, 0.445], ["the", 0.457, 0.505], ["money", 0.505, 0.805], ["was", 0.817, 0.986], ["never", 0.986, 1.274], ["found", 1.274, 1.767]]}, {"text": "Number five. Paris, August 21st, 1911. It's a Monday, and the Louvre is closed.", "start": 88.884, "end": 95.628, "spec": {"shot": "m_louvre", "cut": true, "mood": "calm", "ui": "n5"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.288], ["five", 0.288, 0.721], ["Paris", 1.118, 1.635], ["August 21st, 1911", 1.803, 3.99], ["It's", 4.375, 4.471], ["a", 4.471, 4.507], ["Monday", 4.519, 5.084], ["and", 5.228, 5.312], ["the", 5.324, 5.409], ["Louvre", 5.409, 5.745], ["is", 5.745, 5.829], ["closed", 5.829, 6.394]]}, {"text": "A man in a white worker's smock walks in through the staff entrance. Nobody looks twice. He used to work here.", "start": 96.048, "end": 102.792, "spec": {"shot": "m_smock", "ui": "smock"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.072, 0.12], ["man", 0.12, 0.397], ["in", 0.397, 0.481], ["a", 0.493, 0.565], ["white", 0.565, 0.925], ["worker's", 0.938, 1.394], ["smock", 1.406, 1.803], ["walks", 1.803, 2.188], ["in", 2.2, 2.56], ["through", 2.632, 2.776], ["the", 2.776, 2.837], ["staff", 2.837, 3.209], ["entrance", 3.221, 3.714], ["Nobody", 4.087, 4.303], ["looks", 4.303, 4.507], ["twice", 4.507, 5.288], ["He", 5.697, 5.733], ["used", 5.733, 5.877], ["to", 5.877, 5.925], ["work", 5.926, 6.118], ["here", 6.118, 6.394]]}, {"text": "His name is Vincenzo Peruggia. He walks up to the Mona Lisa, lifts it off the wall, and takes it out of its frame.", "start": 103.212, "end": 110.412, "spec": {"shot": "m_lift", "ui": "lift"}, "afx": null, "words": [["His", 0.096, 0.204], ["name", 0.216, 0.541], ["is", 0.817, 0.925], ["Vincenzo", 0.925, 1.526], ["Peruggia", 1.526, 2.091], ["He", 2.464, 2.512], ["walks", 2.512, 2.728], ["up", 2.728, 2.801], ["to", 2.8, 2.861], ["the", 2.861, 2.921], ["Mona", 2.921, 3.185], ["Lisa", 3.197, 3.654], ["lifts", 4.267, 4.519], ["it", 4.519, 4.591], ["off", 4.591, 4.844], ["the", 4.856, 4.928], ["wall", 4.928, 5.276], ["and", 5.805, 5.877], ["takes", 5.877, 6.118], ["it", 6.118, 6.166], ["out", 6.166, 6.298], ["of", 6.298, 6.346], ["its", 6.346, 6.442], ["frame", 6.442, 6.851]]}, {"text": "At a locked door, a plumber even lets him out, thinking he's staff.", "start": 110.832, "end": 115.392, "spec": {"shot": "m_plumber", "ui": "plumber"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.096, 0.144], ["a", 0.144, 0.18], ["locked", 0.192, 0.589], ["door", 0.589, 0.95], ["a", 1.346, 1.394], ["plumber", 1.406, 1.827], ["even", 1.923, 2.151], ["lets", 2.163, 2.296], ["him", 2.296, 2.38], ["out", 2.38, 2.644], ["thinking", 3.005, 3.437], ["he's", 3.438, 3.654], ["staff", 3.654, 4.207]]}, {"text": "Nobody notices the painting is gone until the next day.", "start": 115.812, "end": 119.052, "spec": {"shot": "m_empty_wall", "ui": "nextday"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Nobody", 0.084, 0.433], ["notices", 0.433, 0.901], ["the", 0.901, 0.998], ["painting", 0.998, 1.55], ["is", 1.55, 1.671], ["gone", 1.671, 2.043], ["until", 2.055, 2.26], ["the", 2.26, 2.32], ["next", 2.332, 2.584], ["day", 2.584, 2.885]]}, {"text": "Police even question Pablo Picasso. And crowds come to the Louvre just to stare at the empty space on the wall.", "start": 119.472, "end": 125.64, "spec": {"shot": "m_crowd", "ui": "crowd"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Police", 0.108, 0.433], ["even", 0.445, 0.673], ["question", 0.685, 1.13], ["Pablo", 1.142, 1.514], ["Picasso", 1.514, 2.199], ["And", 2.584, 2.668], ["crowds", 2.668, 3.029], ["come", 3.029, 3.173], ["to", 3.185, 3.245], ["the", 3.245, 3.329], ["Louvre", 3.329, 3.774], ["just", 3.918, 4.087], ["to", 4.087, 4.135], ["stare", 4.135, 4.495], ["at", 4.495, 4.555], ["the", 4.555, 4.627], ["empty", 4.639, 4.952], ["space", 4.952, 5.337], ["on", 5.337, 5.433], ["the", 5.433, 5.481], ["wall", 5.481, 5.817]]}, {"text": "For two years, the Mona Lisa sits in a trunk in Peruggia's apartment.", "start": 126.06, "end": 131.196, "spec": {"shot": "m_trunk", "ui": "yrs2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["For", 0.132, 0.252], ["two", 0.252, 0.457], ["years", 0.457, 1.106], ["the", 1.358, 1.442], ["Mona", 1.442, 1.755], ["Lisa", 1.755, 2.248], ["sits", 2.512, 2.825], ["in", 2.837, 2.933], ["a", 2.933, 2.969], ["trunk", 2.969, 3.413], ["in", 3.642, 3.75], ["Peruggia's", 3.75, 4.255], ["apartment", 4.255, 4.784]]}, {"text": "Then he takes it to Florence and offers it to an art dealer. The dealer calls in the museum director, and police arrest Peruggia at his hotel.", "start": 131.616, "end": 139.848, "spec": {"shot": "m_florence", "ui": "arrest"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.168], ["he", 0.168, 0.252], ["takes", 0.264, 0.493], ["it", 0.493, 0.553], ["to", 0.553, 0.613], ["Florence", 0.613, 1.262], ["and", 1.466, 1.659], ["offers", 1.671, 2.091], ["it", 2.103, 2.188], ["to", 2.188, 2.308], ["an", 2.308, 2.38], ["art", 2.392, 2.584], ["dealer", 2.596, 3.017], ["The", 3.413, 3.498], ["dealer", 3.498, 3.798], ["calls", 3.81, 4.183], ["in", 4.183, 4.255], ["the", 4.255, 4.291], ["museum", 4.291, 4.796], ["director", 4.796, 5.312], ["and", 5.757, 5.805], ["police", 5.805, 6.19], ["arrest", 6.19, 6.514], ["Peruggia", 6.514, 7.055], ["at", 7.176, 7.26], ["his", 7.26, 7.356], ["hotel", 7.368, 7.885]]}, {"text": "He served only about seven months. And many say the theft is what made the Mona Lisa the most famous painting in the world.", "start": 140.268, "end": 147.636, "spec": {"shot": "m_famous", "ui": "famous"}, "afx": null, "words": [["He", 0.108, 0.156], ["served", 0.156, 0.409], ["only", 0.505, 0.745], ["about", 0.745, 0.962], ["seven", 0.974, 1.322], ["months", 1.322, 1.815], ["And", 2.175, 2.26], ["many", 2.26, 2.464], ["say", 2.476, 2.668], ["the", 2.668, 2.764], ["theft", 2.764, 3.317], ["is", 3.63, 3.75], ["what", 3.75, 3.906], ["made", 3.918, 4.147], ["the", 4.159, 4.207], ["Mona", 4.207, 4.495], ["Lisa", 4.507, 5.036], ["the", 5.276, 5.361], ["most", 5.361, 5.661], ["famous", 5.661, 6.058], ["painting", 6.058, 6.514], ["in", 6.514, 6.562], ["the", 6.562, 6.623], ["world", 6.623, 7.019]]}, {"text": "And the Louvre? In 2025, thieves robbed it again. With a ladder truck, in about seven minutes.", "start": 148.056, "end": 154.632, "spec": {"shot": "m_louvre2025", "ui": "l2025"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.156], ["the", 0.156, 0.24], ["Louvre", 0.252, 0.709], ["In 2025", 1.082, 2.139], ["thieves", 2.38, 2.824], ["robbed", 2.837, 3.173], ["it", 3.173, 3.221], ["again", 3.221, 3.57], ["With", 3.942, 4.026], ["a", 4.026, 4.062], ["ladder", 4.062, 4.435], ["truck", 4.435, 4.808], ["in", 5.036, 5.12], ["about", 5.12, 5.324], ["seven", 5.324, 5.697], ["minutes", 5.697, 6.214]]}, {"text": "Number four. London, Easter weekend, 2015.", "start": 155.052, "end": 159.228, "spec": {"shot": "h_street", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n4"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.312], ["four", 0.312, 0.697], ["London", 1.094, 1.575], ["Easter", 1.791, 2.103], ["weekend", 2.115, 2.584], ["2015", 2.764, 3.81]]}, {"text": "Hatton Garden is London's jewelry district. And under one building sits a vault full of safe deposit boxes.", "start": 159.648, "end": 166.8, "spec": {"shot": "h_vault", "ui": "vault"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Hatton", 0.096, 0.324], ["Garden", 0.325, 0.721], ["is", 0.769, 0.913], ["London's", 0.925, 1.538], ["jewelry", 1.635, 2.043], ["district", 2.055, 2.644], ["And", 3.041, 3.149], ["under", 3.161, 3.353], ["one", 3.353, 3.606], ["building", 3.606, 4.014], ["sits", 4.183, 4.387], ["a", 4.387, 4.423], ["vault", 4.423, 4.868], ["full", 4.94, 5.312], ["of", 5.312, 5.397], ["safe", 5.397, 5.769], ["deposit", 5.769, 6.19], ["boxes", 6.19, 6.803]]}, {"text": "The thieves climb down an elevator shaft. Then they use an industrial drill to bore through a vault wall half a meter thick.", "start": 167.22, "end": 174.876, "spec": {"shot": "h_drill", "ui": "wall50"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.156], ["thieves", 0.168, 0.457], ["climb", 0.469, 0.793], ["down", 0.793, 1.142], ["an", 1.154, 1.274], ["elevator", 1.286, 1.707], ["shaft", 1.707, 2.212], ["Then", 2.596, 2.704], ["they", 2.704, 2.776], ["use", 2.788, 3.017], ["an", 3.017, 3.077], ["industrial", 3.077, 3.642], ["drill", 3.642, 4.087], ["to", 4.279, 4.375], ["bore", 4.387, 4.675], ["through", 4.676, 4.844], ["a", 4.856, 4.892], ["vault", 4.892, 5.3], ["wall", 5.312, 5.709], ["half", 5.926, 6.346], ["a", 6.49, 6.526], ["meter", 6.538, 6.887], ["thick", 6.887, 7.308]]}, {"text": "The alarm goes off. But no police come.", "start": 175.296, "end": 177.96, "spec": {"shot": "h_alarm", "ui": "alarm"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.132], ["alarm", 0.132, 0.469], ["goes", 0.481, 0.721], ["off", 0.733, 1.07], ["But", 1.454, 1.514], ["no", 1.514, 1.659], ["police", 1.671, 2.007], ["come", 2.007, 2.332]]}, {"text": "They walk out with loot worth up to fourteen million pounds.", "start": 178.38, "end": 182.052, "spec": {"shot": "h_loot", "ui": "gbp14"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.096, 0.192], ["walk", 0.192, 0.445], ["out", 0.445, 0.613], ["with", 0.613, 0.769], ["loot", 0.781, 1.082], ["worth", 1.082, 1.358], ["up", 1.358, 1.55], ["to", 1.707, 1.803], ["fourteen", 1.815, 2.44], ["million", 2.452, 2.74], ["pounds", 2.74, 3.329]]}, {"text": "And the gang? Mostly pensioners. Their ringleader was seventy-six years old.", "start": 182.472, "end": 187.512, "spec": {"shot": "h_grandpas", "ui": "age76"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.156], ["the", 0.156, 0.228], ["gang", 0.24, 0.613], ["Mostly", 1.01, 1.298], ["pensioners", 1.298, 2.031], ["Their", 2.416, 2.644], ["ringleader", 2.656, 3.197], ["was", 3.281, 3.45], ["seventy-six", 3.462, 4.171], ["years", 4.171, 4.399], ["old", 4.399, 4.675]]}, {"text": "Their mistake: they used their own cars. Cameras picked them up, and the police tracked them for weeks.", "start": 187.932, "end": 193.812, "spec": {"shot": "h_cars", "ui": "cars"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Their", 0.096, 0.204], ["mistake", 0.204, 0.697], ["they", 0.95, 1.034], ["used", 1.034, 1.226], ["their", 1.226, 1.346], ["own", 1.358, 1.514], ["cars", 1.514, 2.067], ["Cameras", 2.44, 2.764], ["picked", 2.764, 2.993], ["them", 2.993, 3.101], ["up", 3.101, 3.317], ["and", 3.822, 3.882], ["the", 3.882, 3.966], ["police", 3.978, 4.375], ["tracked", 4.387, 4.748], ["them", 4.748, 4.856], ["for", 4.856, 5.0], ["weeks", 5.012, 5.529]]}, {"text": "Most of them got six to seven years. And millions of pounds' worth of the loot is still missing.", "start": 194.232, "end": 199.872, "spec": {"shot": "h_prison", "ui": "missing4"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Most", 0.084, 0.264], ["of", 0.264, 0.312], ["them", 0.312, 0.409], ["got", 0.421, 0.577], ["six", 0.577, 1.01], ["to", 1.022, 1.106], ["seven", 1.106, 1.466], ["years", 1.466, 1.971], ["And", 2.368, 2.464], ["millions", 2.476, 2.921], ["of", 2.921, 3.005], ["pounds'", 3.005, 3.365], ["worth", 3.365, 3.654], ["of", 3.654, 3.702], ["the", 3.702, 3.762], ["loot", 3.762, 4.123], ["is", 4.447, 4.531], ["still", 4.543, 4.868], ["missing", 4.868, 5.288]]}, {"text": "Number three. Dresden, Germany, November 25th, 2019. Around four in the morning.", "start": 200.292, "end": 207.18, "spec": {"shot": "d_city", "cut": true, "ui": "n3"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.072, 0.288], ["three", 0.3, 0.685], ["Dresden", 1.07, 1.695], ["Germany", 1.935, 2.428], ["November 25th, 2019", 2.644, 5.18], ["Around", 5.553, 5.829], ["four", 5.829, 6.046], ["in", 6.046, 6.106], ["the", 6.106, 6.142], ["morning", 6.154, 6.538]]}, {"text": "A fire breaks out in a power box on a bridge. The streetlights go dark.", "start": 207.6, "end": 212.28, "spec": {"shot": "d_fire", "ui": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.096, 0.132], ["fire", 0.144, 0.505], ["breaks", 0.505, 0.889], ["out", 0.901, 1.154], ["in", 1.166, 1.25], ["a", 1.25, 1.298], ["power", 1.31, 1.683], ["box", 1.683, 1.983], ["on", 1.983, 2.091], ["a", 2.091, 2.127], ["bridge", 2.139, 2.668], ["The", 3.053, 3.101], ["streetlights", 3.101, 3.75], ["go", 3.762, 3.918], ["dark", 3.918, 4.327]]}, {"text": "Two men cut through the iron bars of a window and climb into the Green Vault, a royal treasure chamber from the 1700s.", "start": 212.7, "end": 220.548, "spec": {"shot": "d_window", "ui": "window"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Two", 0.096, 0.264], ["men", 0.264, 0.517], ["cut", 0.517, 0.829], ["through", 0.841, 1.094], ["the", 1.106, 1.226], ["iron", 1.31, 1.635], ["bars", 1.635, 1.983], ["of", 1.983, 2.019], ["a", 2.019, 2.067], ["window", 2.079, 2.68], ["and", 2.921, 3.065], ["climb", 3.077, 3.594], ["into", 3.666, 3.81], ["the", 3.81, 3.894], ["Green", 3.894, 4.255], ["Vault", 4.255, 4.579], ["a", 4.988, 5.048], ["royal", 5.048, 5.457], ["treasure", 5.469, 5.865], ["chamber", 5.877, 6.214], ["from", 6.226, 6.334], ["the", 6.334, 6.382], ["1700s", 6.382, 7.488]]}, {"text": "They smash a display case with an axe.", "start": 220.968, "end": 223.464, "spec": {"shot": "d_axe", "ui": "axe"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.108, 0.204], ["smash", 0.204, 0.577], ["a", 0.577, 0.625], ["display", 0.637, 1.082], ["case", 1.082, 1.418], ["with", 1.418, 1.538], ["an", 1.55, 1.623], ["axe", 1.635, 2.139]]}, {"text": "And grab jewelry set with more than four thousand diamonds. Worth more than one hundred and thirteen million euros.", "start": 223.884, "end": 230.604, "spec": {"shot": "d_jewels", "ui": "eur113"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.204], ["grab", 0.216, 0.589], ["jewelry", 0.589, 0.974], ["set", 0.974, 1.31], ["with", 1.322, 1.478], ["more", 1.478, 1.767], ["than", 1.767, 1.887], ["four", 1.887, 2.368], ["thousand", 2.368, 2.788], ["diamonds", 2.788, 3.377], ["Worth", 3.774, 3.93], ["more", 3.942, 4.159], ["than", 4.171, 4.315], ["one", 4.327, 4.507], ["hundred", 4.507, 4.82], ["and", 4.82, 4.964], ["thirteen", 4.976, 5.553], ["million", 5.565, 5.829], ["euros", 5.829, 6.382]]}, {"text": "Their getaway car was later found burned in an underground garage.", "start": 231.024, "end": 235.08, "spec": {"shot": "d_car", "ui": "burned"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Their", 0.096, 0.3], ["getaway", 0.312, 0.649], ["car", 0.649, 0.962], ["was", 0.962, 1.118], ["later", 1.13, 1.49], ["found", 1.49, 1.971], ["burned", 1.983, 2.464], ["in", 2.536, 2.644], ["an", 2.644, 2.752], ["underground", 2.764, 3.173], ["garage", 3.173, 3.702]]}, {"text": "But police tracked down the gang, members of a Berlin crime family.", "start": 235.5, "end": 239.676, "spec": {"shot": "d_police", "ui": "clan"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.108, 0.192], ["police", 0.204, 0.481], ["tracked", 0.493, 0.805], ["down", 0.805, 0.998], ["the", 0.998, 1.046], ["gang", 1.058, 1.454], ["members", 1.875, 2.2], ["of", 2.2, 2.236], ["a", 2.236, 2.296], ["Berlin", 2.296, 2.909], ["crime", 2.921, 3.305], ["family", 3.305, 3.822]]}, {"text": "In 2022, most of the jewels came back as part of a deal. And in 2023, five men were convicted.", "start": 240.096, "end": 247.464, "spec": {"shot": "d_return", "ui": "back"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In 2022", 0.084, 0.998], ["most", 1.478, 1.683], ["of", 1.683, 1.731], ["the", 1.731, 1.791], ["jewels", 1.791, 2.163], ["came", 2.163, 2.416], ["back", 2.416, 2.897], ["as", 2.969, 3.065], ["part", 3.065, 3.293], ["of", 3.305, 3.341], ["a", 3.341, 3.401], ["deal", 3.413, 3.822], ["And", 4.219, 4.303], ["in 2023", 4.315, 5.336], ["five", 5.733, 6.082], ["men", 6.082, 6.322], ["were", 6.334, 6.442], ["convicted", 6.454, 7.019]]}, {"text": "But some pieces are still missing today.", "start": 247.884, "end": 249.948, "spec": {"shot": "d_missing", "ui": "missing3"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.084, 0.156], ["some", 0.156, 0.312], ["pieces", 0.312, 0.697], ["are", 0.697, 0.769], ["still", 0.781, 0.998], ["missing", 0.998, 1.286], ["today", 1.286, 1.707]]}, {"text": "Number two. Antwerp, Belgium. The diamond capital of the world. February 2003.", "start": 250.368, "end": 257.016, "spec": {"shot": "a_city", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.312], ["two", 0.312, 0.613], ["Antwerp", 1.01, 1.406], ["Belgium", 1.502, 1.983], ["The", 2.344, 2.428], ["diamond", 2.428, 2.776], ["capital", 2.788, 3.197], ["of", 3.197, 3.269], ["the", 3.269, 3.329], ["world", 3.329, 3.738], ["February 2003", 4.207, 6.298]]}, {"text": "A man named Leonardo Notarbartolo rents an office in the Antwerp Diamond Center. For over two years, he plays the part of a diamond trader.", "start": 257.436, "end": 266.412, "spec": {"shot": "a_office", "ui": "yrs2b"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.072, 0.12], ["man", 0.12, 0.457], ["named", 0.457, 0.793], ["Leonardo", 0.805, 1.418], ["Notarbartolo", 1.43, 2.404], ["rents", 2.752, 3.017], ["an", 3.017, 3.137], ["office", 3.149, 3.714], ["in", 3.858, 3.954], ["the", 3.966, 4.05], ["Antwerp", 4.062, 4.447], ["Diamond", 4.447, 4.736], ["Center", 4.736, 5.144], ["For", 5.589, 5.757], ["over", 5.757, 5.986], ["two", 5.986, 6.214], ["years", 6.214, 6.719], ["he", 7.103, 7.163], ["plays", 7.163, 7.404], ["the", 7.404, 7.5], ["part", 7.512, 7.728], ["of", 7.74, 7.788], ["a", 7.788, 7.837], ["diamond", 7.837, 8.161], ["trader", 8.173, 8.618]]}, {"text": "Below the building sits a vault with a combination lock, heat sensors, a seismic sensor, radar, and a magnetic field.", "start": 266.832, "end": 274.632, "spec": {"shot": "a_vault", "ui": "layers"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Below", 0.096, 0.349], ["the", 0.349, 0.433], ["building", 0.433, 0.805], ["sits", 0.817, 1.046], ["a", 1.046, 1.094], ["vault", 1.094, 1.49], ["with", 1.502, 1.647], ["a", 1.647, 1.683], ["combination", 1.695, 2.344], ["lock", 2.344, 2.728], ["heat", 2.957, 3.149], ["sensors", 3.161, 3.846], ["a", 4.062, 4.099], ["seismic", 4.111, 4.579], ["sensor", 4.579, 5.072], ["radar", 5.505, 6.034], ["and", 6.31, 6.418], ["a", 6.526, 6.55], ["magnetic", 6.551, 7.019], ["field", 7.019, 7.44]]}, {"text": "His crew beat them one by one. Hairspray on the heat sensor. A foam shield in front of the infrared. Tape over the light sensor.", "start": 275.052, "end": 282.564, "spec": {"shot": "a_beat", "ui": "beat"}, "afx": null, "words": [["His", 0.084, 0.18], ["crew", 0.18, 0.421], ["beat", 0.481, 0.721], ["them", 0.721, 0.853], ["one", 0.853, 1.01], ["by", 1.01, 1.154], ["one", 1.154, 1.514], ["Hairspray", 1.899, 2.38], ["on", 2.38, 2.452], ["the", 2.464, 2.5], ["heat", 2.5, 2.728], ["sensor", 2.728, 3.245], ["A", 3.642, 3.69], ["foam", 3.702, 4.026], ["shield", 4.026, 4.459], ["in", 4.471, 4.555], ["front", 4.555, 4.808], ["of", 4.82, 4.868], ["the", 4.88, 4.928], ["infrared", 4.94, 5.529], ["Tape", 5.926, 6.154], ["over", 6.166, 6.346], ["the", 6.346, 6.406], ["light", 6.406, 6.671], ["sensor", 6.671, 7.163]]}, {"text": "Over one weekend, they opened one hundred and nine of one hundred and eighty-nine safe deposit boxes.", "start": 282.984, "end": 288.336, "spec": {"shot": "a_boxes", "ui": "boxes109"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Over", 0.096, 0.312], ["one", 0.312, 0.529], ["weekend", 0.541, 1.034], ["they", 1.382, 1.514], ["opened", 1.526, 1.887], ["one", 2.019, 2.188], ["hundred", 2.188, 2.488], ["and", 2.488, 2.536], ["nine", 2.536, 2.897], ["of", 2.909, 2.969], ["one", 2.969, 3.053], ["hundred", 3.053, 3.281], ["and", 3.293, 3.329], ["eighty-nine", 3.329, 3.702], ["safe", 3.714, 3.978], ["deposit", 3.978, 4.375], ["boxes", 4.375, 5.0]]}, {"text": "The haul was worth more than one hundred million dollars. People called it the heist of the century.", "start": 288.756, "end": 294.036, "spec": {"shot": "a_haul", "ui": "usd100"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.156], ["haul", 0.156, 0.385], ["was", 0.397, 0.529], ["worth", 0.529, 0.745], ["more", 0.745, 1.082], ["than", 1.094, 1.238], ["one", 1.238, 1.358], ["hundred", 1.358, 1.659], ["million", 1.659, 1.947], ["dollars", 1.959, 2.536], ["People", 2.945, 3.209], ["called", 3.209, 3.546], ["it", 3.546, 3.618], ["the", 3.63, 3.714], ["heist", 3.714, 4.255], ["of", 4.267, 4.315], ["the", 4.327, 4.387], ["century", 4.387, 4.94]]}, {"text": "Then, on the way out, they dumped their trash in a forest next to the highway.", "start": 294.456, "end": 298.608, "spec": {"shot": "a_forest", "ui": "trash"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.373], ["on", 0.601, 0.709], ["the", 0.709, 0.781], ["way", 0.781, 0.998], ["out", 1.01, 1.238], ["they", 1.238, 1.334], ["dumped", 1.394, 1.659], ["their", 1.659, 1.803], ["trash", 1.803, 2.368], ["in", 2.368, 2.44], ["a", 2.452, 2.488], ["forest", 2.488, 2.933], ["next", 2.945, 3.137], ["to", 3.137, 3.185], ["the", 3.185, 3.245], ["highway", 3.245, 3.81]]}, {"text": "The landowner found it the next morning. Inside was a half-eaten salami sandwich.", "start": 299.028, "end": 303.732, "spec": {"shot": "a_sandwich", "ui": "sandwich"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.168], ["landowner", 0.168, 0.649], ["found", 0.649, 0.937], ["it", 0.938, 1.022], ["the", 1.034, 1.106], ["next", 1.106, 1.418], ["morning", 1.418, 1.779], ["Inside", 2.175, 2.512], ["was", 2.512, 2.62], ["a", 2.62, 2.668], ["half-eaten", 2.668, 3.317], ["salami", 3.317, 3.702], ["sandwich", 3.702, 4.351]]}, {"text": "The DNA on it helped convict the gang. Notarbartolo got ten years.", "start": 304.152, "end": 308.88, "spec": {"shot": "a_dna", "ui": "dna10"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.168], ["DNA", 0.18, 0.685], ["on", 0.685, 0.877], ["it", 0.877, 0.937], ["helped", 0.95, 1.19], ["convict", 1.202, 1.659], ["the", 1.659, 1.731], ["gang", 1.731, 2.103], ["Notarbartolo", 2.476, 3.353], ["got", 3.365, 3.582], ["ten", 3.582, 3.858], ["years", 3.858, 4.375]]}, {"text": "But most of the diamonds were never found.", "start": 309.3, "end": 311.508, "spec": {"shot": "a_never", "ui": "never2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.096, 0.18], ["most", 0.18, 0.433], ["of", 0.433, 0.481], ["the", 0.481, 0.541], ["diamonds", 0.541, 0.95], ["were", 0.962, 1.046], ["never", 1.046, 1.37], ["found", 1.382, 1.851]]}, {"text": "And number one. Boston, March 18th, 1990. The early hours of the morning.", "start": 311.928, "end": 317.856, "spec": {"shot": "g_street", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n1"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.156], ["number", 0.156, 0.385], ["one", 0.385, 0.661], ["Boston", 1.07, 1.502], ["March 18th, 1990", 2.007, 3.966], ["The", 4.363, 4.423], ["early", 4.435, 4.724], ["hours", 4.724, 5.06], ["of", 5.072, 5.12], ["the", 5.12, 5.168], ["morning", 5.18, 5.577]]}, {"text": "Two men in police uniforms ring the bell at the Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum. They say they're responding to a disturbance.", "start": 318.276, "end": 325.668, "spec": {"shot": "g_bell", "ui": "uniform"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Two", 0.084, 0.252], ["men", 0.252, 0.469], ["in", 0.481, 0.589], ["police", 0.589, 1.034], ["uniforms", 1.034, 1.659], ["ring", 1.671, 1.995], ["the", 1.995, 2.067], ["bell", 2.067, 2.464], ["at", 2.704, 2.788], ["the", 2.788, 2.873], ["Isabella", 2.969, 3.462], ["Stewart", 3.474, 3.966], ["Gardner", 3.978, 4.267], ["Museum", 4.267, 4.712], ["They", 5.096, 5.18], ["say", 5.18, 5.409], ["they're", 5.409, 5.541], ["responding", 5.541, 6.106], ["to", 6.118, 6.25], ["a", 6.25, 6.286], ["disturbance", 6.286, 7.043]]}, {"text": "The guard breaks the rules, and lets them in.", "start": 326.088, "end": 328.776, "spec": {"shot": "g_letin", "ui": "rules"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.168], ["guard", 0.168, 0.469], ["breaks", 0.481, 0.781], ["the", 0.781, 0.853], ["rules", 0.853, 1.478], ["and", 1.707, 1.815], ["lets", 1.815, 1.959], ["them", 1.959, 2.079], ["in", 2.079, 2.32]]}, {"text": "Minutes later, both guards are tied up in the basement.", "start": 329.196, "end": 332.244, "spec": {"shot": "g_basement", "ui": "tied"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Minutes", 0.096, 0.324], ["later", 0.325, 0.721], ["both", 0.95, 1.19], ["guards", 1.19, 1.466], ["are", 1.478, 1.55], ["tied", 1.562, 1.887], ["up", 1.887, 2.079], ["in", 2.091, 2.151], ["the", 2.151, 2.199], ["basement", 2.2, 2.68]]}, {"text": "For about eighty minutes, the thieves walk through the museum.", "start": 332.664, "end": 336.048, "spec": {"shot": "g_walk", "ui": "min80"}, "afx": null, "words": [["For", 0.12, 0.204], ["about", 0.204, 0.457], ["eighty", 0.469, 0.673], ["minutes", 0.685, 1.166], ["the", 1.394, 1.502], ["thieves", 1.502, 1.875], ["walk", 1.875, 2.32], ["through", 2.32, 2.476], ["the", 2.476, 2.536], ["museum", 2.536, 3.029]]}, {"text": "They take thirteen works. Rembrandt's Storm on the Sea of Galilee. Vermeer's The Concert.", "start": 336.468, "end": 341.916, "spec": {"shot": "g_take", "ui": "works13"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.096, 0.156], ["take", 0.156, 0.325], ["thirteen", 0.325, 0.829], ["works", 0.841, 1.322], ["Rembrandt's", 1.695, 2.127], ["Storm", 2.127, 2.5], ["on", 2.5, 2.572], ["the", 2.572, 2.62], ["Sea", 2.62, 3.041], ["of", 3.053, 3.137], ["Galilee", 3.149, 3.702], ["Vermeer's", 4.099, 4.507], ["The", 4.507, 4.579], ["Concert", 4.579, 5.084]]}, {"text": "Together, worth around five hundred million dollars. The biggest art theft in history.", "start": 342.336, "end": 348.264, "spec": {"shot": "g_value", "ui": "usd500"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Together", 0.096, 0.529], ["worth", 0.938, 1.142], ["around", 1.142, 1.478], ["five", 1.575, 1.923], ["hundred", 1.923, 2.224], ["million", 2.224, 2.584], ["dollars", 2.584, 3.161], ["The", 3.57, 3.642], ["biggest", 3.738, 4.111], ["art", 4.123, 4.351], ["theft", 4.363, 4.844], ["in", 4.916, 5.012], ["history", 5.024, 5.565]]}, {"text": "The museum offers a reward of ten million dollars. It has never been paid.", "start": 348.684, "end": 353.58, "spec": {"shot": "g_reward", "ui": "reward10"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.144], ["museum", 0.144, 0.721], ["offers", 0.877, 1.19], ["a", 1.19, 1.226], ["reward", 1.226, 1.767], ["of", 1.827, 1.935], ["ten", 1.935, 2.296], ["million", 2.296, 2.584], ["dollars", 2.584, 3.185], ["It", 3.57, 3.606], ["has", 3.606, 3.726], ["never", 3.738, 4.002], ["been", 4.002, 4.147], ["paid", 4.159, 4.531]]}, {"text": "The FBI later named two suspects. Both are dead.", "start": 354.0, "end": 357.744, "spec": {"shot": "g_fbi", "ui": "fbi"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.168], ["FBI", 0.168, 0.673], ["later", 0.685, 1.022], ["named", 1.034, 1.322], ["two", 1.406, 1.671], ["suspects", 1.671, 2.512], ["Both", 2.921, 3.077], ["are", 3.077, 3.125], ["dead", 3.125, 3.401]]}, {"text": "And today, the empty frames still hang on the wall. Waiting for the paintings to come home.", "start": 358.164, "end": 363.852, "spec": {"shot": "g_frames_end", "mood": "calm", "ui": "frames"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.156], ["today", 0.156, 0.649], ["the", 1.058, 1.154], ["empty", 1.274, 1.55], ["frames", 1.55, 2.163], ["still", 2.356, 2.608], ["hang", 2.608, 2.861], ["on", 2.861, 2.933], ["the", 2.945, 3.005], ["wall", 3.005, 3.341], ["Waiting", 3.726, 3.954], ["for", 3.954, 4.038], ["the", 4.038, 4.123], ["paintings", 4.123, 4.699], ["to", 4.699, 4.784], ["come", 4.784, 4.988], ["home", 5.0, 5.337]]}, {"text": "So, which heist was the boldest? Tell me in the comments. And subscribe to Roundhead Stories for more true money stories.", "start": 364.272, "end": 371.736, "spec": {"shot": "outro", "mood": "bright", "ui": "end"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.096, 0.385], ["which", 0.577, 0.721], ["heist", 0.721, 1.142], ["was", 1.154, 1.262], ["the", 1.262, 1.334], ["boldest", 1.334, 1.959], ["Tell", 2.356, 2.488], ["me", 2.5, 2.608], ["in", 